The Infinix X6525 is a Unisoc UMS9230 (Tiger T606) handset, being ported to a close-to-mainline
kernel. U-Boot is chainloaded from the Android boot partition and the root filesystem boots from a
microSD card, so the stock Android installation and its data are left untouched.

